# Template of the API keys. Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill in
# the values. ".env" is excluded from version control (.gitignore): never share
# it, never commit it, never paste its content into a notebook.
# Format: NAME=value, one per line, with no comment on the same line.
#
# The CKAN APIs of Porto and Águeda are public: no key is needed to run
# notebooks/00_data_collection.ipynb or the six analysis notebooks.
#
# OpenAI: only needed to regenerate the anchor texts (GENERATE_ANCHORS = True in
# Section 5 of notebooks/00_data_collection.ipynb). The generation has a cost.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
